# ============================================================================
# Mawzun app frontend — environment template
#
# Vite bakes VITE_* values in at BUILD time (`npm run build`), not runtime.
# With nothing set, the build works exactly as checked in.
# ============================================================================

# --- API routing -------------------------------------------------------------
# Production default: https://api.mawzun.org (baked into src/lib/api/http.ts
# if unset). Dev default: same-origin proxy -> http://localhost:5000.
VITE_API_ORIGIN=https://api.mawzun.org

# --- Dev-only proxy target ---------------------------------------------------
# Where `vite dev` relays /api/* calls (src/routes/api/public/proxy/$.ts).
# Defaults to http://localhost:5000; override to point the dev proxy at a
# hosted backend.
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:5000

# --- Cloudflare Turnstile (captcha) ------------------------------------------
# Set to render the managed Turnstile widget (src/components/Turnstile).
# Unset = widget disabled. The BACKEND's TURNSTILE_SECRET must also be set
# for server-side verification; site key + secret come from the same
# Cloudflare Turnstile site.
# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAAAAA...

# --- Request retries ---------------------------------------------------------
# How many times a request that FAILED is retried before the error is shown.
# Default 0 = no retries (the behaviour before this setting existed).
#
# Only transient failures are retried: a network error, a 5xx, or a 429. A
# 400/401/403/404/422 is the server's settled answer and is never repeated —
# retrying it would waste a round-trip and delay a message that will not change.
#
# Writes are NOT retried by default. Repeating a POST whose response was lost
# can create the row twice, and the server cannot tell a retry from a second
# request. Endpoints that are safe to repeat opt in individually.
#
# Capped at 5. A larger value is treated as 5; a negative or non-numeric value
# is treated as 0.
# VITE_API_RETRY_COUNT=2
